## 9. Figures and tables

The generators are in `figures/gen/` (`common.py`, `style.py`, `venue.json` shared; one script per figure or table). Each reads `results/`
(read-only, the analysis tables), computes no result of its own, and writes the PDF/TeX and the CSV of the plotted values. Figures are vector PDFs with Type 42 fonts, cropped
to the 5.5 in text width (`style.save`), and a check (`style.check_min_type`) stops a script if any text is below 8 pt. From the repository root, with the environment of section 1:

```
cd figures/gen
for f in fig1_regime_map fig3_bias_sd fig5_tiers fig6_cluster fig7_diagnostic fig9_coverage figA2_variance figA4_p figA8_robust figA9_orfit figP6_interval; do python3 $f.py ../../results ..; done
for f in t1_mechanisms t2_acceptance t3_regime; do python3 $f.py ../../results ../../tables; done
```

